  "panels": [
    {
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "### AMO production overview (account 768512802988)\n\nAll panels here read from the `CloudWatch: tb-legacy (AMO prod)` datasource, which assumes the cross-account role `mzla-tb-legacy-grafana-cloudwatch`. **That role does not exist yet** (platform-grafana#45 / addons-server#394) -- until it is created every panel below will show \"no data\" or a datasource error, not because traffic is absent but because the grant is missing.\n\n`amo-prod` and `amo-prod-versioncheck` are both busy production ALBs (hundreds of thousands of requests/hour each); an empty panel once the role exists means something is wrong, not that traffic is quiet.\n\n**Cache Hit Rate** for the two CloudFront distributions will read empty even once the role exists: neither `E1PQMC7BGJOP5E` (versioncheck) nor `EGX44RIFURRUW` (services) has a CloudFront `MonitoringSubscription` enabled (verified read-only, `NoSuchMonitoringSubscription`), and that metric only publishes when one is. Enabling it is an AWS change in the legacy account and is out of scope for this dashboard.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "amo-prod ALB",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "cloudwatch",
        "uid": "${cloudwatch_tb_legacy_uid}"
      },
      "description": "Total requests received by the amo-prod ALB. CloudWatch publishes only Sum for this metric.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ],
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
