      },
      "description": "CPU utilization for each of the six atn-web-stream9 instances behind amo-prod, one series per instance so a single hot instance is never hidden behind five idle ones. Each instance is alerted on individually at > 85% for 15m in terraform/alerting-amo-edge.tf (observed max over a day peaked at ~76% without incident). Do not modify these instances -- see the ATN hard limits.",
